=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Kurou-Morou} after completing the prerequisite quests.
* Speak to Ilumida ({z:Upper Jeuno} G-8) until she gives you a cutscene requesting you obtain a {@k} {k:Moondrop}.
* Travel to {z:The Boyahda Tree} and examine a **???** at H-8 in 2nd map of {z:The Boyahda Tree} between 19:00 and 04:00 to spawn an {p:Ahriman|Category:Ahriman} NM {m:Agas}.
** Home Point #1 (Cloister of Storms) is close to the objective.
* Once defeated, examine the **???** again between the hours of 19:00 and 04:00 to get the {@k} {k:Moondrop}.
* Return to {z:Upper Jeuno} and talk to {n:Ilumida} for your reward.
* You may speak to Kurou-Morou once more to see a cutscene, but it is not necessary for your reward.

=3 Agas
* Agas will not spawn during a New Moon (type /clock) as the moon must be visible to some degree.
* {m:Agas} uses __Level 5 Petrify__, which will petrify any characters with a level divisible by 5.
* Only one person in the party needs to spawn {m:Agas} to get the whole party their {@k} {k:Moondrop}.
* Casts Tier 3 single target and AoE-aga black magic spells.
* {m:Agas} is soloable at level 75 by a Beastmaster with the charmable mobs around the area. A couple of Summoners would also work.
** {m:Korrigan} are more resistant to charm than the {m:Skimmers|Skimmer} around the tree.
* Also soloable by a BLU at 75 utilizing Headbutt to stop spells and abilities.
* Otherwise, any party or player with Trusts can take out Agas.

